208	     * 1-July boundaries between its {@code registrationDate} and today, derived via
209	     * {@code FiscalYear} so it matches the fiscal year the membership number and {@code fiscalYear}
210	     * label use. Returns 0 when no registration date is stored (or it lies in the future), so an
211	     * owner with no recorded tenure never qualifies for the tenure-gated points.
212	     */
213	    default long tenureFiscalYears(Owner owner) {
